# 工具前向测试的可再生输入/输出；验收摘要写入docs，不作为研究证据归档。
/data/reviews/*forward-test*/
/data/reviews/**/score-rules.md
/data/reviews/**/valuation-rules.md
# 降耗实测工作副本；每轮final保留失败/成功评价、冻结输入和两路审核快照。
/data/reviews/triplet-token-cycle-*/round-*/writer/
/data/reviews/triplet-token-cycle-*/round-*/evidence/
/data/reviews/triplet-token-cycle-*/round-*/numeric/
/data/reviews/triplet-token-cycle-*/round-*/external/
/data/reviews/triplet-token-cycle-*/round-*/repair-sol/
/data/reviews/triplet-token-cycle-*/round-*/rebuilt-sol/
/data/reviews/**/source-views/

# 终局验收快照是复核依据，嵌套原路径也不能被工作副本规则误排除。
!/data/reviews/**/final/inputs/**
!/data/reviews/**/final-terminal/inputs/**

# 外部评审上传包为源码与验收记录副本，复盘正文仍保存在docs。
/exports/three-report-review-*/

